Package: fbnardl
Type: Package
Title: Fourier Bootstrap Nonlinear ARDL Estimation
Version: 1.0.3
Authors@R: person("Muhammad", "Alkhalaf", email = "muhammedalkhalaf@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-2677-9246"))
Description: Provides two estimators for asymmetric nonlinear ARDL models with
    flexible Fourier terms: the Fourier NARDL (FNARDL) with Kripfganz and
    Schneider (2020) <doi:10.1111/obes.12376> critical values, and the Fourier
    Bootstrap NARDL (FBNARDL) with bootstrap cointegration tests following
    Bertelli, Vacca and Zoia (2022) <doi:10.1007/s10260-021-00571-7>.
    The nonlinear ARDL framework decomposes regressors into positive and
    negative partial sums (Shin, Yu and Greenwood-Nimmo, 2014)
    <doi:10.1007/978-1-4899-8008-3_9>. Lag and Fourier frequency selection
    uses information criteria following Yilanci, Bozoklu and Gorus (2020)
    <doi:10.1177/0193841X18823479>.
Author: Muhammad Alkhalaf [aut, cre, cph]
    (<https://orcid.org/0009-0002-2677-9246>)
